# A six-seat Practice table on a desktop by keys: set up, seated, paused and resumed by Escape, the hint (H),
# then played out (S skips the AI's turns, C checks or calls) to the results; Retry seats a new table.
# viewport 1600x900@1
until 600 =Daily challenge
frames 60
save p-title
click =Play
until 300 Choose your table
frames 10
save p-modes
click Play Practice
until 300 Take your seat
frames 10
click =4 seats
frames 10
click =6 seats
frames 10
save p-setup
click =Take your seat
until 600 Table status
until 900 =Fold
frames 60
save p-table
key KeyH 1
frames 10
save p-hint
key Escape 1
until 300 Resume
frames 20
save p-pause
key Escape 1
frames 30
repeat 4000 until Breakdown
  key KeyS 1
  frames 3
  key KeyC 1
  frames 3
end
frames 60
save p-results
expect Practice is unranked
click =Retry
until 600 Table status
frames 30
